<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $20 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $20 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $20 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 7.35 percent from 7.25 percent at Monday's close.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99979 pesos from 0.99982 pesos.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0651))</p>
</text>
